   <conbody class="- topic/body  concept/conbody " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/sensor_information_and_specifications/vibration_sensors.dita" xtrc="conbody:1;24:13"><ul class="- topic/ul " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/sensor_information_and_specifications/vibration_sensors.dita" xtrc="ul:1;24:17">
            <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/sensor_information_and_specifications/vibration_sensors.dita" xtrc="li:1;25:17">
               <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/sensor_information_and_specifications/vibration_sensors.dita" xtrc="p:1;26:19">This section describes the information and specifications related to vibration sensors on the SMS.</p>
               <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/sensor_information_and_specifications/vibration_sensors.dita" xtrc="p:2;27:19">Vibrations monitoring and analysis are at the core of most condition-based monitoring systems as vibrations and harmonic signatures are often the first indication of an impending motor failure.</p>
               <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/sensor_information_and_specifications/vibration_sensors.dita" xtrc="p:3;28:19">ADI OtoSense™ SMS is equipped with a Vibration X-axis (tangential vibration) sensor and a Vibration Z-axis (axial vibration) sensor. For specifications, see Table 3.</p>
            </li>
         </ul>
